-- Events: the vMaNGOS spawn sets of the event quest givers that never appeared here (AQ War Effort camp NPCs and Commendation
-- Officers, the Colossus researchers, the Argent Dawn Scourge Invasion NPCs). The events keep the vMaNGOS ids and have no start
-- time, so they stay off until a GM starts one (.event start <id>). vMaNGOS drives them from scripts this core does not have
-- (war effort counters, the Scourge Invasion necropolises), so their quests that need those (Necrotic Runes) are not usable yet.
-- Spawn guids are the vMaNGOS guid + 20000000, as for the other vMaNGOS spawns; flags stay NULL (template).
DELETE FROM `game_event` WHERE `eventEntry` IN (17,22,52,62,63,64,99);
